From 540b3a9705a2414b3db64172b4942840bbbd3bc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:51:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): move Set WCS from features to the WCS page

The feature picks (roles Origin / X / Y / Z) that set the WCS origin and
axes are a group of the WCS page, above Work offset. The Setup page keeps
only the part orientation, stock and setup groups. Same commands, same
undo; the pick gate follows the drawn row, so Pick for WCS works there.

Fixes #1926

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
